 gtui  gardens                                                                     auto-refresh off 
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
  ╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   
  │                                                                                             │   
  │  Navigation                        Actions                       Tools                      │   
  │  ↑/↓   move (also j/k)             l      launcher menu          s Shell                    │   
  │  enter open / details              *      toggle favorite        S Shell (control plane)    │   
  │  esc/h back                        !      problems only          9 k9s                      │   
  │  /     filter (fuzzy)              o      sort shoots            K k9s (control plane)      │   
  │  tab   seeds of the garden         y      copy name, path, …     c kubectl                  │   
  │  A     all shoots of the garden    v      shoot YAML             C kubectl (control plane)  │   
  │  g/G   first / last                ctrl+r favorites & recent     f sofka                    │   
  │                                    ctrl+g go to technical ID     F sofka (control plane)    │   
  │                                    p      toggle provider-env                               │   
  │                                    w      toggle new window                                 │   
  │                                    r      refresh                                           │   
  │                                    a      toggle auto-refresh                               │   
  │                                    ?      help                                              │   
  │                                    q      quit                                              │   
  │                                                                                             │   
  │  Tool keys work on shoots, seeds, details and recent targets;                               │   
  │  in those views they win over j/k/g/G. Tools: ~/.garden/gtui.yaml                           │   
  │  Press any key to close.                                                                    │   
